{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107540","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107540","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1710754001:1":{"text":"왕자님, 거슬리던 소란을 드디어 잠재웠군요. 왕자님을 위한 무대도 이미 준비되었습니다.","source_cn":"殿下，不合时宜的喧闹终于平息了。为您准备的舞台也已布置妥当。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C2F4D6196C10FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710754002:1":{"text":"딜그레이 경, 오늘 밤 연회는 어디까지나 임시방편일 뿐입니다...","source_cn":"迪尔格雷，今夜这场宴会终究是权宜之计……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD03E388007D57A40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710754003:0":{"text":"이제부터가 진짜 중요하지요.","source_cn":"接下来的事，才是重中之重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FC8F6BD060A5BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710754004:0":{"text":"오늘 낮과 같은 일이 발생하면 절대 안 됩니다!","source_cn":"绝不能再出现白天的意外！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7952639C466D4901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710754005:0":{"text":"염려 마시지요.","source_cn":"殿下尽可放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA53D8DA313E3425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710754006:0":{"text":"낮에 있었던 일은... 그저 왕자님의 성대한 피날레를 장식할, 작은 여흥이었다고 생각하시면 됩니다.","source_cn":"白日不过是小小插曲，是为您那盛大剧目的终章……略作点缀罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x809066F86A177CAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710754007:0":{"text":"저희의 계획대로 세워진 무대입니다. 그 어떤 불청객도 방해할 수 없을 겁니다.","source_cn":"帷幕已在您我计划中升起，绝不会再被任何不速之客所打乱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E92688484A076E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710754008:1":{"text":"모두의 주목을 받고 당당히 나서시지요. 그게 바로 이번 연극의 가장 완벽한 엔딩이 될 테니까요.","source_cn":"待您在万众瞩目下凯旋归来，这出戏的最后一幕便可完美启幕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F43929FE8374839","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710754009:0":{"text":"그럼, 시작하지요.","source_cn":"如此就好。我们开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC99BD8C694D36CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:迪尔格雷":{"text":"딜그레이","source":"迪尔格雷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"오리안","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}